# Root-level ignore — each subproject (frontend/, backend/, ml-engine/) also
# has its own .gitignore for stack-specific files (build/, __pycache__, etc).
# This one exists to stop the mistakes already cleaned up once: a stray
# root node_modules/package-lock.json, and macOS .DS_Store files.

node_modules/
.DS_Store
*.DS_Store
.env
.env.local